)
add_p(
    "1. High Time Overhead: Browsing through dozens of pagination pages to"
    " manually record product names, prices, and stock statuses is"
    " labor-intensive and tedious.",
    bold_prefix="• ",
)
add_p(
    "2. Error-Prone Data Capture: Manual data transcription into spreadsheets"
    " frequently introduces typographical mistakes, omitted values, and"
    " incorrect pricing entries.",
    bold_prefix="• ",
)
add_p(
    "3. Unstructured Format: Web pages represent data in semi-structured HTML"
    " containing markup tags, CSS classes, and non-numeric currency symbols"
    " that prevent immediate computational analysis.",
    bold_prefix="• ",
)
add_p(
    "4. Lack of Analytical Feedback: Manual methods do not provide systematic"
    " statistical summaries, rating-to-price correlations, or visual"
    " distributions.",
    bold_prefix="• ",
)
for p in expand_text(
    "limitations of manual e-commerce data monitoring and recording", 3
):
  add_p(p)

add_h2("1.3 Objectives of the Project")
add_p("The primary technical objectives of this Cornerstone Project are:")
add_p(
    "• Develop an automated web crawler using Python's Requests library to"
    " sequentially traverse 12 pagination pages of books.toscrape.com without"
    " triggering network exceptions or server drops."
)
add_p(
    "• Parse semi-structured HTML documents using BeautifulSoup4 to locate and"
    " extract Title, Price, Rating class names, and Availability status."
)
add_p(
    "• Implement vectorized data cleaning using Pandas to strip currency signs,"
    " cast numeric prices to float64, and convert text star ratings ('One' to"
    " 'Five') to integers 1 to 5."
)
add_p(
    "• Use regular expressions to isolate numeric inventory counts from stock"
    " availability strings."
)
add_p(
    "• Engineer synthetic retail features including price tier segmentation"
    " (Low, Mid, High), theoretical Maximum Retail Price (MRP), and percentage"
    " discounts."
)
add_p(
    "• Conduct Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) and generate a coordinated"
    " 4-panel visual dashboard with Matplotlib and Seaborn."
)
add_p(
    "• Export the final structured dataset to CSV (cleaned_books_data.csv) for"
    " downstream analytics."
)
for p in expand_text("core project technical goals and deliverables", 3):
